msgstr "当源为 Dolby Vision MEL 时，显示在 Splash 图标底部的圆角条颜色。"

msgctxt "#32373"
msgid "Other Dolby Vision"
msgstr "其他 Dolby Vision"

msgctxt "#32374"
msgid "Color of the pill shown at the bottom of the splash logo for any other Dolby Vision profile (no enhancement layer)."
msgstr "适用于其他任何 Dolby Vision 配置（无增强层）时，显示在 Splash 图标底部的圆角条颜色。"

