msgstr "EL / 类型"

msgctxt "#32383"
msgid "Converted output"
msgstr "转换后的输出"

msgctxt "#32384"
msgid "Keep the HDR/DV area when converting to SDR"
msgstr "转换为 SDR 时保留 HDR/DV 区域"

msgctxt "#32385"
msgid "Keeps the HDR static-metadata and Dolby Vision panels on screen while VS10 converts the source to SDR. Turn off to draw the overlay in its SDR layout instead."
msgstr "在 VS10 将源转换为 SDR 期间，仍显示 HDR 静态元数据面板和杜比视界面板。关闭后，叠加层改用 SDR 布局。"

msgctxt "#32386"
msgid "Keep the Dolby Vision area when converting to HDR10"
msgstr "转换为 HDR10 时保留杜比视界区域"

msgctxt "#32387"
msgid "Keeps the Dolby Vision panels on screen while VS10 converts a Dolby Vision source to HDR10. Turn off to show the HDR static-metadata panel instead."
msgstr "在 VS10 将杜比视界源转换为 HDR10 期间，仍显示杜比视界面板。关闭后，改为显示 HDR 静态元数据面板。"

msgctxt "#32388"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示"

msgctxt "#32389"
msgid "Dolby Vision metadata"
msgstr "杜比视界元数据"

msgctxt "#32390"
msgid "OK button: \"Back\""
msgstr "OK 键：\"返回\""

msgctxt "#32391"
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "调试"

msgctxt "#32392"
msgid "Diagnostic views for reading what a stream actually carries. Off by default; nothing here changes playback."
msgstr "用于查看数据流实际携带内容的诊断视图。默认关闭；其中的选项不会改变播放。"

msgctxt "#32393"
msgid "Dolby Vision metadata view"
msgstr "杜比视界元数据视图"

msgctxt "#32394"
msgid "Lets OK open the Dolby Vision metadata view while the TinyPPI overlay is up and a Dolby Vision source is playing. It lists every block the stream's side data carries — the configuration record, the RPU from its header through L11, the trim passes and the static SEIs. OK returns to the normal TinyPPI view, Back closes TinyPPI. On any other source OK does nothing."
msgstr "在 TinyPPI 叠加层打开且正在播放杜比视界源时，按 OK 打开杜比视界元数据视图。它会列出该数据流附加数据中的每个块——配置记录、从头部到 L11 的 RPU、修剪参数以及静态 SEI。再按 OK 返回普通 TinyPPI 视图，按返回关闭 TinyPPI。其他源按 OK 无效。"

msgctxt "#32395"
msgid "Changed values"
msgstr "变化的数值"

msgctxt "#32396"
msgid "Color for the readings that just changed in the Dolby Vision metadata view. The view refreshes once a second, and a value that moved is written in this color until it stands still again, so the live readings can be told from the ones that do not move."
msgstr "杜比视界元数据视图中刚刚变化的数值的颜色。该视图每秒刷新一次，变化的数值会以此颜色显示，直到它不再变化为止，这样便能将实时变化的数值与静止的数值区分开。"

msgctxt "#32397"
msgid "[COLOR=FF82B1FF]●[/COLOR] Light blue (Default)"
msgstr "[COLOR=FF82B1FF]●[/COLOR] 浅蓝色 (默认)"

msgctxt "#32398"
msgid "Move with the arrow keys"
msgstr "使用方向键移动"

msgctxt "#32399"
msgid "Lets the arrow keys on the remote move the TinyPPI overlay around the screen while it is open. The move is not saved: the next launch starts from the position configured above. Off by default, so the arrow keys do nothing while TinyPPI is up."
msgstr "允许在 TinyPPI 叠加层打开时，用遥控器的方向键在屏幕上移动它。移动结果不会保存：下次打开时仍使用上面设置的位置。默认关闭，此时方向键在 TinyPPI 打开期间不起作用。"

msgctxt "#32401"
msgid "Color laid over the whole screen behind the Dolby Vision metadata view. Off by default; raise its opacity to dim the picture behind it."
msgstr "在杜比视界元数据视图后面覆盖整个屏幕的颜色。默认关闭；提高其不透明度可让后面的画面变暗。"

msgctxt "#32403"
msgid "Background color of the metadata view itself."
msgstr "元数据视图本身的背景颜色。"

msgctxt "#32405"
msgid "Color of the heading at the top of the metadata view."
msgstr "元数据视图顶部标题的颜色。"

msgctxt "#32407"
msgid "Color of the Dolby Vision logo in the top right corner."
msgstr "右上角杜比视界标志的颜色。"

msgctxt "#32409"
msgid "Color of the section headings, such as RPU or L2 — Trims."
msgstr "章节标题的颜色，例如 RPU 或 L2 — Trims。"

msgctxt "#32410"
msgid "Column headings"
msgstr "列标题"

msgctxt "#32411"
msgid "Color of the column headings in the trim tables: Slope, Offset, Power and the rest."
msgstr "trim 表格中列标题的颜色：Slope、Offset、Power 等。"

msgctxt "#32413"
msgid "Color of the field names down the left column."
msgstr "左列字段名称的颜色。"

msgctxt "#32415"
msgid "Color of the readings. A value that just changed is written in the \"Changed values\" color instead, for as long as it keeps changing."
msgstr "读数的颜色。刚刚变化的数值会改用\"变化的数值\"颜色显示，直到它不再变化为止。"

msgctxt "#32417"
msgid "Color of the rules under the section headings and above and below the list."
msgstr "章节标题下方以及列表上下分隔线的颜色。"

msgctxt "#32419"
